==Battleground==
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>, delay 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>.
*1 [[Idol Mihara & Cat (Enemy)|Idol Mihara & Cat]] spawns as the boss after 14 seconds<sup>420f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just like the [[Road to Hiroshi Evolution (Easy)|previous level]] this level is also easy, all the enemies are very weak including [[Idol Mihara & Cat (Enemy)|Idol Mihara & Cat]], it only has 30,000 HP and 3,000 attack so once again your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are able to beat this level. The remaining enemies will help with getting money in this level.

